{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The Nephilim</b> Three times in the Masorah: one plene and two defective: הנפלים היו בארץ — defective; כי ראינו את הנפלים (Numbers 13:33) — we saw the Nephilim, defective; בני ענק מן הנפלים (Numbers 13:33) — plene. The two defective ones are Sihon and Og etc., as stated in Niddah: Sihon and Og were sons of Shemhazai and Azazel, and fell from heaven in the days of the Flood generation; therefore it is written here הנפלים היו בארץ defective."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:41.060778748Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}